 right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa e 2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/10 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 04\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o XV Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o Trail Running 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O XV Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o Trail Running realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 10 de abril de 2027, com partidas e chegadas no largo da Aldeia Hist\u00f3rica do Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o (Serra do A\u00e7or), percorrendo trilhos dos concelhos de Arganil e Oliveira do Hospital, no distrito de Coimbra.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Ultra de 53 km (2950 m D+, limite de 10h30) parte \u00e0s 08:30; o Trail Longo de 25 km (1500 m D+, limite de 7h00) parte \u00e0s 09:00; o Trail Curto de 13 km (670 m D+, limite de 4h00) parte \u00e0s 09:30; e a Caminhada \/ Corrida n\u00e3o competitiva de 13 km (670 m D+, limite de 4h00) inicia-se \u00e0s 09:40. A entrega de pr\u00e9mios est\u00e1 agendada para as 15:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 4 de abril de 2027 (limitadas a 200 vagas nos 53 km, 200 nos 25 km, 200 nos 13 km e 100 na Caminhada): at\u00e9 31 de outubro de 2026 custam 42,00 \u20ac (53 km), 26,00 \u20ac (25 km), 12,00 \u20ac (13 km) e 10,00 \u20ac (Caminhada); de 1 de novembro a 31 de dezembro custam 45,00 \u20ac, 27,00 \u20ac, 13,00 \u20ac e 10,00 \u20ac; e de 1 de janeiro a 4 de abril de 2027 fixam-se em 47,00 \u20ac, 29,00 \u20ac, 14,00 \u20ac e 12,00 \u20ac. Associados ADAC t\u00eam 1,50 \u20ac de desconto nos 25 km.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio e onde est\u00e3o os postos de abastecimento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nas provas competitivas \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel carregado, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito e copo pr\u00f3prio (a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos). Os abastecimentos localizam-se em Aldeia das Dez, Ch\u00e3o Sobral, Ch\u00e3 d'\u00c9gua, Malhada Ch\u00e3 e Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o (nos 53 km), Ch\u00e3 d'\u00c9gua, Malhada Ch\u00e3 e Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o (nos 25 km) e Ch\u00e3 d'\u00c9gua e Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o (nos 13 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e que servi\u00e7os adicionais est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Posto de Turismo do Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o na sexta-feira (9 de abril, das 16:00 \u00e0s 21:00) e no s\u00e1bado (10 de abril, das 07:30 \u00e0s 09:35). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip MyLaps, pr\u00e9mio de finalista, massagem na chegada e banhos na antiga escola do Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o. O almo\u00e7o opcional custa 3,50 \u20ac (4,50 \u20ac para acompanhantes) e a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica opcional custa 5,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"XV Pi\u00f3d\u00e3o Trail Runni